    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classQfTcpReceiver" kindref="compound">QfTcpReceiver</ref> connects to a device and feeds the QgsNmeaConnection over a TCP socket. It receives QgsGpsInformation and converts it to <ref refid="classQfGnssPositionInformation" kindref="compound">QfGnssPositionInformation</ref> </para>
